#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n"
"  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. "
"`cdn` selects the CDN\n"
"  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for "
"(default jsDelivr);\n"
"  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the "
"generated markup's\n"
"  `lang`/`dir` attributes."
msgstr ""
"`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n"
"  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. "
"`cdn` selects the CDN\n"
"  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for "
"(default jsDelivr);\n"
"  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the "
"generated markup's\n"
"  `lang`/`dir` attributes."

