"tokens into the theme."

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Every token is exposed as a `var(--instui-*)` reference (not a concrete "
"value), so Tailwind\n"
"utilities like `bg-color-background-base` theme through the same CSS custom "
"properties that\n"
"`@pantoken/css` emits — light/dark and high-contrast all keep working."
msgstr ""
"Every token is exposed as a `var(--instui-*)` reference (not a concrete "
