msgid ""
"A custom `-icon-<name>` swaps the status glyph but keeps the variant's "
"coloured bar; the bar fill is re-asserted at higher specificity so the "
"shared icon painter doesn't consume it. A direct close button defaults to "
"small; add a size modifier to override it."
msgstr ""
