#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token "
"palette; primary by default."
msgstr ""
"`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token "
"palette; primary by default."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box "
"stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient "
"text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills "
"on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-"
"opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-"
"background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also "
"sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/"
"`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in "
"values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's "
"`.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr ""
"The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box "
"stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient "
"text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills "
"on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-"
"opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-"
"background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also "
"sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/"
"`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in "
"values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's "
"`.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."

