msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-card` — A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "`.instui-card` — A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Variant** controls how direct children are styled: `content` (default) "
"leaves them\n"
"  unstyled; `container` stacks them as bordered, padded sections. Padding "
"scales with\n"
"  viewport width and is the same across both variants.\n"
"  **Size** is fully responsive — padding and border-radius step up "
"automatically at 320px\n"
"  (20rem) and 640px (40rem) via standard `min-width` media queries; no size "
"class is needed.\n"
"  Pair with `@pantoken/components` for heading, button, and other inline "
"components."
msgstr ""
"**Variant** controls how direct children are styled: `content` (default) "
"leaves them\n"
"  unstyled; `container` stacks them as bordered, padded sections. Padding "
"scales with\n"
"  viewport width and is the same across both variants.\n"
"  **Size** is fully responsive — padding and border-radius step up "
"automatically at 320px\n"
"  (20rem) and 640px (40rem) via standard `min-width` media queries; no size "
"class is needed.\n"
"  Pair with `@pantoken/components` for heading, button, and other inline "
"components."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Use `<article>` as the card element when the card is a self-contained unit "
"of content;\n"
"  use `<section>` when grouped within a larger landmark. In `-variant-"
"container`, prefer\n"
"  `<section>` elements as direct children so each bordered region carries "
"semantic meaning."
msgstr ""
"Use `&lt;article&gt;` as the card element when the card is a self-contained "
"unit of content;\n"
"  use `&lt;section&gt;` when grouped within a larger landmark. In `-variant-"
"container`, prefer\n"
"  `&lt;section&gt;` elements as direct children so each bordered region "
"carries semantic meaning."

