#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the "
"tray."
msgstr ""
"`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the "
"tray."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` "
"breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` "
"container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, "
"matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr ""
"Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` "
"breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` "
"container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, "
"matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with "
"`aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr ""
"Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with "
"`aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."

