"primary scrollable content pane."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-"
"inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows "
"`direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr ""
"`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-"
"inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows "
"`direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
