#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and "
"inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr ""
"`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and "
"inline, required, or readonly layouts."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` "
"(after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-"
"inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it "
"above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; "
"chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr ""
"An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` "
"(after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-"
"inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it "
"above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; "
"chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
