"subtitle, and optional background image."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ Use Hero when:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n"
"- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n"
"- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n"
"🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr ""
"- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n"
"- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n"
"- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n"
"🚫 Don't use Hero when:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n"
"- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr ""
"- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n"
"- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n"
"- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n"
"- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr ""
"- Ensure the title is in an `&lt;h1&gt;` tag for semantic structure\n"
"- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n"
"- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"

