"icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any "
"element."
msgstr ""
"`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-"
"icon-&lt;name&gt;` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any "
"element."

