"modifiers that stack."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, "
"so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` "
"crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr ""
