"Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--"
"color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. "
"Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example "
"`-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr ""
"Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-&lt;name&gt;`, `.--text-&lt;name&gt;` "
"(aliased as `.--color-&lt;name&gt;`), and `.--border-&lt;name&gt;` for the "
"curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached "
"alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-&lt;component&gt;`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare "
"or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr ""
"`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-&lt;value&gt;` — usable "
"bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long "
"(`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component "
"(`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from "
"a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr ""
"Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long "
"(`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component "
"(`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from "
"a component-specific token may have it overridden."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` "
"painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr ""
"The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-&lt;name&gt;` "
"painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-"
"<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-&lt;value&gt;` and `.--text-"
"align-&lt;value&gt;` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained "
"onto any component."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-"
"overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto "
"any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr ""
"A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-"
"overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto "
"any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-"
"<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any "
"component."
msgstr ""
