"Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-"
"transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-"
"scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr ""
"Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-"
