#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and "
"centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a "
"native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these "
"modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other "
"component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr ""
"`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and "
"centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a "
"native `&lt;dialog&gt;` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these "
"modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other "
"component) — see the `mask` global utility."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/"
"formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr ""
"**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/"
"formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."

#: css/mask.md css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay "
"modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable "
"bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` "
"element."
msgstr ""
"`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay "
"modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable "
"bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` "
"element."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/"
"formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr ""
"**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/"
"formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."

