"payload."

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens "
"become `COLOR`\n"
"variables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else "
"`STRING`. Icons are\n"
"excluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables]"
"(functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\n"
"plugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has "
"the plugin glue."
msgstr ""
"It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens "
"become `COLOR`\n"
"variables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else "
"`STRING`. Icons are\n"
"excluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables]"
"(functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\n"
"plugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has "
"the plugin glue."

