#: formats/components/src/functions/componentsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Build the aggregated component stylesheet: every component's rules in the "
"`COMPONENTS` concat order.\n"
"The size-alias and alias twins are appended PER COMPONENT (within its own "
"chunk) so each alias\n"
"documents on its own page — the aliases are discovered from each record's "
"`@alias {@link -x}` or\n"
"`@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata (see `withAliases`), not a central hand-"
"kept list. The\n"
"`--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale the components reference is defined in "
"the token sheet\n"
"(`@pantoken/css`), so it's no longer inlined here."
msgstr ""
"Build the aggregated component stylesheet: every component's rules in the "
"`COMPONENTS` concat order.\n"
"The size-alias and alias twins are appended PER COMPONENT (within its own "
"chunk) so each alias\n"
"documents on its own page — the aliases are discovered from each record's "
"`@alias {@link -x}` or\n"
"`@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata (see `withAliases`), not a central hand-"
"kept list. The\n"
"`--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale the components reference is defined in "
"the token sheet\n"
"(`@pantoken/css`), so it's no longer inlined here."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Build the elevation token block: `<selector> { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. "
"Shipped inside\n"
"`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), "
"and reusable by other\n"
"layered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."
msgstr ""
"Build the elevation token block: `&lt;selector&gt; { --instui-elevation-*: "
"… }`. Shipped inside\n"
"`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), "
"and reusable by other\n"
"layered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the rule selector (default `:root`)."
msgstr "`selector` — the rule selector (default `:root`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
