#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/"
"css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n"
"[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--"
"instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\n"
"that dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the "
"wire. Both carry the\n"
"elevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure "
"builders live in\n"
"`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring "
"against the token sheet\n"
"alone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files "
"at\n"
"`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr ""
"[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/"
"css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n"
"[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--"
"instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\n"
"that dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the "
"wire. Both carry the\n"
"elevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure "
"builders live in\n"
"`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring "
"against the token sheet\n"
"alone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files "
"at\n"
"`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

