#: formats/css/src/variables/leanCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The lean `rebrand` stylesheet string — the full sheet minus the `--instui-"
"icon-*` glyph tokens (the\n"
"~1,777 icon data-URIs that make up most of [css](css.md)). Roughly a sixth "
"the size over the wire; the\n"
"recommended foundation for CDN/embed delivery. Components reference only a "
"handful of icons, shipped\n"
"separately as `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; consumers who "
"use `var(--instui-icon-*)`\n"
"broadly should load the full [css](css.md) (or the `icons.css` glyph sheet). "
"See\n"
"`@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr ""
"The lean `rebrand` stylesheet string — the full sheet minus the `--instui-"
"icon-*` glyph tokens (the\n"
"~1,777 icon data-URIs that make up most of [css](css.md)). Roughly a sixth "
"the size over the wire; the\n"
"recommended foundation for CDN/embed delivery. Components reference only a "
"handful of icons, shipped\n"
"separately as `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; consumers who "
"use `var(--instui-icon-*)`\n"
"broadly should load the full [css](css.md) (or the `icons.css` glyph sheet). "
"See\n"
"`@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

