msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Target resolution (first match wins):\n"
"1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n"
"2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n"
"3. walk up to the nearest `<dialog>`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"
msgstr ""
"Target resolution (first match wins):\n"
"1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n"
"2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n"
"3. walk up to the nearest `&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`, or `[data-"
"dismissible]`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Dismiss strategy:\n"
"- `<dialog>` → `dialog.close()`\n"
"- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n"
"- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"
msgstr ""
"Dismiss strategy:\n"
"- `&lt;dialog&gt;` → `dialog.close()`\n"
"- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n"
"- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"

