"Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/"
"PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\n"
"the native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). "
"The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\n"
