"on the separate\n"
"`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry stays free of that exotic "
"dependency."
msgstr ""
"Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/"
"PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\n"
"the native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). "
"The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\n"
"which needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`) lives "
"on the separate\n"
"`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry remains free of that exotic "
"dependency."

