#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema "
"(`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\n"
"initial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and "
"reference values,\n"
"plus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). "
"Icons are rolled in as `<image>` tokens.\n"
"Every pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer "
"needs the\n"
"(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."
msgstr ""
"A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema "
"(`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\n"
"initial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and "
"reference values,\n"
"plus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). "
"Icons are rolled in as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens.\n"
"Every pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer "
"needs the\n"
"(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."

