#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the "
"hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n"
"`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. "
"Consumers\n"
"(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to "
"warn — never error — when a plugin is\n"
"registered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks "
"unavailable) or a\n"
"factoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin "
"passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr ""
"[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the "
"hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n"
"`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. "
"Consumers\n"
"(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to "
"warn — never error — when a plugin is\n"
"registered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks "
"unavailable) or a\n"
"factoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin "
"passed to `toCss`)."

