#: packages/utils/src/functions/globalModifierSelector.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Build a global-utility modifier selector: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. "
"The modifier class\n"
"repeated 3x gives the rule (0,3,0) specificity, which deterministically "
"outranks any real 2-class\n"
"component-modifier compound (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) regardless of "
"source order — the `:where(*)`\n"
"wrapper contributes zero specificity of its own, so it's purely "
"documentation that this is a global\n"
"modifier, not a scoping condition. A plain class selector already matches "
"standalone (`--mt-lg` with\n"
"no other class) or chained onto any component, core or plugin-authored, with "
"no per-component\n"
"enumeration needed. Replaces the old bare-class-plus-enumerated-per-"
"component-compound pattern\n"
"(`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), which couldn't reach plugin-authored "
"components and didn't scale\n"
"to high-cardinality utilities like spacing."
msgstr ""
"Build a global-utility modifier selector: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. "
"The modifier class\n"
"repeated 3x gives the rule (0,3,0) specificity, which deterministically "
"outranks any real 2-class\n"
"component-modifier compound (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) regardless of "
"source order — the `:where(*)`\n"
"wrapper contributes zero specificity of its own, so it's purely "
"documentation that this is a global\n"
"modifier, not a scoping condition. A plain class selector already matches "
"standalone (`--mt-lg` with\n"
"no other class) or chained onto any component, core or plugin-authored, with "
"no per-component\n"
"enumeration needed. Replaces the old bare-class-plus-enumerated-per-"
"component-compound pattern\n"
"(`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), which couldn't reach plugin-authored "
"components and didn't scale\n"
"to high-cardinality utilities like spacing."

