#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken "
"packages: the token\n"
"reference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes "
"(typed via `arkregex`),\n"
"kebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing "
"scale, reference-drift\n"
"validation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both "
"`@pantoken/components`\n"
"(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build "
"on. Depends only on\n"
"`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without "
"pulling the GitHub-only\n"
"upstream."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken "
"packages: the token\n"
"reference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes "
"(typed via `arkregex`),\n"
"kebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing "
"scale, reference-drift\n"
"validation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both "
"`@pantoken/components`\n"
"(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build "
"on. Depends only on\n"
"`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without "
"pulling the GitHub-only\n"
"upstream."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/"
"utils/token-syntax`\n"
"entry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON "
"load that breaks when\n"
"pulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-"
"facing packages (e.g.\n"
"`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr ""
"The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/"
"utils/token-syntax`\n"
"entry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON "
"load that breaks when\n"
"pulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-"
"facing packages (e.g.\n"
"`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add "
"new helpers there and\n"
"re-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr ""
"A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add "
"new helpers there and\n"
"re-export them here, don't grow this file."

