"In relative `hsl()`, the `l` channel resolves to a `<number>` on the 0–100 "
"scale — the same scale\n"
"tinycolor's `amount` uses — so the points are subtracted directly (no `%`)."
msgstr ""
"In relative `hsl()`, the `l` channel resolves to a `&lt;number&gt;` on the 0–"
"100 scale — the same scale\n"
"tinycolor's `amount` uses — so the points are subtracted directly (no `%`)."

