#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-"
"only stand-in for\n"
"ui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA "
"colors into one opaque\n"
"result; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly "
"a two-color\n"
"`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS "
"color, so this covers the\n"
"opaque-base case only."
msgstr ""
"Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-"
"only stand-in for\n"
"ui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA "
"colors into one opaque\n"
"result; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly "
"a two-color\n"
"`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS "
"color, so this covers the\n"
"opaque-base case only."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
