#: plugins/pantoken/custom-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Brings in icons that aren't part of the InstUI set (product/brand marks, "
"etc.) as\n"
"`--instui-icon-<name>` image tokens — the same namespace and `.-icon-<name>` "
"painter class the\n"
"built-in InstUI icons use, so a custom icon drops into `.instui-icon -icon-"
"<name>` exactly like a\n"
"built-in one. No `custom-` prefix: on a name collision, the built-in InstUI "
"icon should win (load\n"
"it after this plugin's CSS in any combine URL)."
msgstr ""
"Brings in icons that aren't part of the InstUI set (product/brand marks, "
"etc.) as\n"
"`--instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` image tokens — the same namespace and `.-icon-"
"&lt;name&gt;` painter class the\n"
"built-in InstUI icons use, so a custom icon drops into `.instui-icon -icon-"
"&lt;name&gt;` exactly like a\n"
"built-in one. No `custom-` prefix: on a name collision, the built-in InstUI "
"icon should win (load\n"
"it after this plugin's CSS in any combine URL)."

