"`topmost`) so layers stack\n"
"predictably instead of by hand-tuned magic numbers. This plugin emits `--"
"instui-stacking-<level>`\n"
"tokens, resolved to concrete z-index values from the shipped `--instui-"
"component-view-stacking-*`\n"
"tokens, for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css`/`@pantoken/"
"tokens` pipeline directly.\n"
"The matching `.instui-stack-<level>` utility classes now live in `@pantoken/"
"components`' own\n"
"`stacking` utility."
msgstr ""
"InstUI's `View` exposes a stacking scale (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, "
"`topmost`) so layers stack\n"
"predictably instead of by hand-tuned magic numbers. This plugin emits `--"
"instui-stacking-&lt;level&gt;`\n"
"tokens, resolved to concrete z-index values from the shipped `--instui-"
"component-view-stacking-*`\n"
"tokens, for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css`/`@pantoken/"
"tokens` pipeline directly.\n"
"The matching `.instui-stack-&lt;level&gt;` utility classes now live in "
"`@pantoken/components`' own\n"
"`stacking` utility."

