#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain "
"custom-property\n"
"declarations."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain "
"custom-property\n"
"declarations."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, "
"`inherits`, and\n"
"`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 "
"bytes of boilerplate per\n"
"property — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained "
"bundle where type\n"
"registration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each "
"`@property` block with a\n"
"simple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all "
"that overhead."
msgstr ""
"`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, "
"`inherits`, and\n"
"`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 "
"bytes of boilerplate per\n"
"property — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained "
"bundle where type\n"
"registration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each "
"`@property` block with a\n"
"simple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all "
"that overhead."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed "
"transitions/animations,\n"
"`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles "
"where those semantics\n"
"are not needed."
msgstr ""
"**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed "
"transitions/animations,\n"
"`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles "
"where those semantics\n"
"are not needed."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."

