#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names "
"to minimal sequential\n"
"identifiers."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names "
"to minimal sequential\n"
"identifiers."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-"
"readable but expensive in\n"
"minified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, "
"every `var()` call,\n"
"and every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name "
"— across definitions,\n"
"`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--"
"a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n"
"…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr ""
"Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-"
"readable but expensive in\n"
"minified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, "
"every `var()` call,\n"
"and every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name "
"— across definitions,\n"
"`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--"
"a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n"
"…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a "
"deterministic mapping,\n"
"then assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest]"
"(interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets "
"multiple\n"
"separate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately "
"processed CSS files that will\n"
"be loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr ""
"Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a "
"deterministic mapping,\n"
"then assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest]"
"(interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets "
"multiple\n"
"separate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately "
"processed CSS files that will\n"
"be loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; "
"shortest for large sets)\n"
"- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … "
"(alphanumeric)\n"
"- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr ""
"- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; "
"shortest for large sets)\n"
"- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … "
"(alphanumeric)\n"
"- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after "
"processing.\n"
"The message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-"
"custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr ""
"When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after "
"processing.\n"
"The message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-"
"custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) "
"and writes new\n"
"ones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same "
"`Map` instance to\n"
"every `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files "
"which will be\n"
"loaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical "
"name mapping."
msgstr ""
"On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) "
"and writes new\n"
"ones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same "
"`Map` instance to\n"
"every `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files "
"which will be\n"
"loaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical "
"name mapping."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest "
"before the component\n"
"sheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr ""
"Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest "
"before the component\n"
"sheets add their (typically overlapping) references."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/"
"mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr ""
"Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/"
"mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, "
"`var()` references,\n"
"and `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, "
"deterministic mapping, then\n"
"assigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence "
"throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr ""
"Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, "
"`var()` references,\n"
"and `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, "
"deterministic mapping, then\n"
"assigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence "
"throughout the stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
