msgstr "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. "
"Plugin order:\n"
"`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the "
"input unchanged when\n"
"no options are set."
msgstr ""
"Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. "
"Plugin order:\n"
"`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the "
"input unchanged when\n"
"no options are set."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
