#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "The transformed CSS string."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle "
"transforms for\n"
"`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/"
"applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle "
"transforms for\n"
"`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/"
"applyMinify.md) utility."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` "
"for a consistent\n"
"minification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr ""
"Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` "
"for a consistent\n"
"minification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--"
"instui-*)` references\n"
"and their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers "
"(`@pantoken/css` +\n"
"`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr ""
"**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--"
"instui-*)` references\n"
"and their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers "
"(`@pantoken/css` +\n"
"`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n"
"`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files "
"loaded together.\n"
"Process the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr ""
"**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n"
"`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files "
"loaded together.\n"
"Process the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake "
"unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr ""
"Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake "
"unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and "
"the component\n"
"rules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr ""
"Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and "
"the component\n"
"rules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert "
"`@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr ""
"Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert "
"`@property` at-rules to plain declarations."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, "
"`onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\n"
"Pass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to "
"override individual defaults."
msgstr ""
"`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, "
"`onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\n"
"Pass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to "
"override individual defaults."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long "
"`--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long "
"`--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: "
"\"base26\"`).\n"
"Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to "
"override individual defaults — including\n"
"`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr ""
"`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: "
"\"base26\"`).\n"
"Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to "
"override individual defaults — including\n"
"`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties "
"from a composed\n"
"stylesheet."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties "
"from a composed\n"
"stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 "
"icon data-URIs\n"
"included). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of "
"the system would\n"
"otherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting "
"from the `var()`\n"
"references in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps "
"only the custom\n"
"properties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` "
"registrations."
msgstr ""
"pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 "
"icon data-URIs\n"
"included). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of "
"the system would\n"
"otherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting "
"from the `var()`\n"
"references in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps "
"only the custom\n"
"properties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` "
"registrations."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The "
"factory returns a\n"
"plain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency "
"— `postcss` is only\n"
"a type."
msgstr ""
"It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The "
"factory returns a\n"
"plain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency "
"— `postcss` is only\n"
"a type."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr ""
"Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n"
"(`@media (theme: <name>)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit "
"concrete CSS for a\n"
"chosen target theme."
msgstr ""
"`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n"
"(`@media (theme: &lt;name&gt;)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then "
"emit concrete CSS for a\n"
"chosen target theme."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes "
"non-target theme\n"
"branches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps "
"always-true theme-only media\n"
"wrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` "
"declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr ""
"The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes "
"non-target theme\n"
"branches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps "
"always-true theme-only media\n"
"wrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` "
"declarations from emitted CSS."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Renames and re-exports [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"
msgstr ""
"Renames and re-exports [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the theme custom-media plugin."
msgstr "Options for the theme custom-media plugin."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
