msgstr "The TypeDoc application."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Move every `@demo` block tag on a comment into `demo` fences appended to its "
"summary, in order.\n"
"Block-tag content gets re-fenced by the markdown theme, so the fence must "
"live in the summary\n"
"prose, which is emitted verbatim."
msgstr ""
"Move every `@demo` block tag on a comment into `demo` fences appended to its "
"summary, in order.\n"
"Block-tag content gets re-fenced by the markdown theme, so the fence must "
"live in the summary\n"
"prose, which is emitted verbatim."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
