#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM "
"(`._pendo-*`) to match\n"
"Instructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It "
"includes responsive\n"
"violet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, "
"and controls. The\n"
"component CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken "
"supplies the tokens and the\n"
"assembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped "
"stylesheet; compact\n"
"suffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs, and an `instui-"
"banner` prefix extends the\n"
"banner surface to popovers and surveys while keeping their overlay elevation."
msgstr ""
"Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM "
"`._pendo-*`) to match\n"
"Instructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It "
"includes responsive\n"
"violet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, "
"and controls. The\n"
"component CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken "
"supplies the tokens and the\n"
"assembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped "
"stylesheet; compact\n"
"suffixes on that class select banner colours and glyphs, and an `instui-"
"banner` prefix extends the\n"
"banner surface to popovers and surveys while keeping their overlay elevation."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; "
"[pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n"
"(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/"
"global.css`."
msgstr ""
"[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; "
"[pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n"
"(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/"
"global.css`."

