#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../"
"functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\n"
"under its `prefix` option — `icon` → `<instui-icon>` by default, or `<x-"
"icon>` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\n"
"A prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so "
"an empty or nullish prefix\n"
"falls back to the default `instui`."
msgstr ""
"The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../"
"functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\n"
"under its `prefix` option — `icon` → `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` by default, or "
"`&lt;x-icon&gt;` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\n"
"A prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so "
"an empty or nullish prefix\n"
"falls back to the default `instui`."

