"to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`,\n"
"`size` to `-size-&lt;size&gt;`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-"
"rectangle`; slotted content is the\n"
"initials, or an `&lt;img&gt;` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."

