"adds spacing around the\n"
"host (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the "
"label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional "
"`popovertargetaction`) toggles any\n"
"light-DOM `[popover]` such as `<instui-context-view>`, `<instui-popover>`, "
"or `<instui-tray>`, and\n"
"`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`<instui-modal>` "
"with `--show`/`--close`,\n"
"etc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it "
"resolves across the shadow\n"
"boundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."
msgstr ""
"It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional "
"`popovertargetaction`) toggles any\n"
"light-DOM `[popover]` such as `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, `&lt;instui-"
"popover&gt;`, or `&lt;instui-tray&gt;`, and\n"
"`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`&lt;instui-"
"modal&gt;` with `--show`/`--close`,\n"
"etc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it "
"resolves across the shadow\n"
"boundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."

