#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-date-input>` — a text field plus a calendar dropdown. The trigger "
"toggles a `[popover]`\n"
"through the built-in `toggle-popover` Invoker Command (a click fallback "
"covers browsers without the\n"
"API); picking a day in the nested `<instui-calendar>` fills the field (ISO "
"`yyyy-mm-dd`), closes the\n"
"popover, and emits a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Typing a "
"valid `yyyy-mm-dd` (or\n"
"clearing it) and committing on the input's `change` works too. `value` is "
"the ISO date, `label` the\n"
"accessible name (default `Date`), and `placeholder` the hint (default `yyyy-"
"mm-dd`)."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` — a text field plus a calendar dropdown. The "
"trigger toggles a `[popover]`\n"
"through the built-in `toggle-popover` Invoker Command (a click fallback "
"covers browsers without the\n"
"API); picking a day in the nested `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;` fills the field "
"(ISO `yyyy-mm-dd`), closes the\n"
"popover, and emits a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Typing a "
"valid `yyyy-mm-dd` (or\n"
"clearing it) and committing on the input's `change` works too. `value` is "
"the ISO date, `label` the\n"
"accessible name (default `Date`), and `placeholder` the hint (default `yyyy-"
"mm-dd`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateTimeInput.md
