msgid ""
"`<instui-date-time-input>` — a nested `<instui-date-input>` plus a native "
"time field. A change to\n"
"either recomputes a combined `value` (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, or just the date "
"when no time) and emits\n"
"a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Setting `value` splits it "
"back across the two\n"
"fields."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` — a nested `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` plus "
"a native time field. A change to\n"
"either recomputes a combined `value` (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, or just the date "
"when no time) and emits\n"
"a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Setting `value` splits it "
"back across the two\n"
"fields."

