#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/drawerLayout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-drawer-layout>` — a side tray plus main content area. The `open` "
"attribute reveals the\n"
"tray; `placement` (`start`|`end`) picks the side. Drivable from light DOM "
"via Invoker Commands:\n"
"`<button command=\"--toggle|--open|--close\" commandfor=\"drawer-id\">`. "
"Content goes in the default\n"
"slot; the tray in `slot=\"tray\"`. The interactions behavior auto-toggles "
"overlay mode based on the\n"
"`--pantoken-bp-md` threshold."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-drawer-layout&gt;` — a side tray plus main content area. The "
"`open` attribute reveals the\n"
"tray; `placement` (`start`|`end`) picks the side. Drivable from light DOM "
"via Invoker Commands:\n"
"`<button command=\"--toggle|--open|--close\" commandfor=\"drawer-id\">`. "
"Content goes in the default\n"
"slot; the tray in `slot=\"tray\"`. The interactions behavior auto-toggles "
"overlay mode based on the\n"
"`--pantoken-bp-md` threshold."

