#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/drilldown.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-drilldown>` — a stateful, multi-level menu over the menu styles. "
"Each level is a light-DOM\n"
"`[data-page=\"id\"]` whose inner `.item`s are cloned into a shadow `.instui-"
"menu`; an item with\n"
"`data-goto=\"id\"` descends to that page and a synthesized Back row (or any "
"`[data-back]` item)\n"
"returns. The light DOM is the data source only — with no `<slot>` it never "
"renders, so shadow CSS\n"
"fully styles each panel. The `active` attribute reflects the current page "
"and can be set to\n"
"navigate; a bubbling `navigate` event (`detail.page`) fires on every move. "
"Drivable from light DOM\n"
"via Invoker Commands: `<button command=\"--goto\" commandfor=\"dd-id\" data-"
"page=\"…\">` descends and\n"
"`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"dd-id\">` returns."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-drilldown&gt;` — a stateful, multi-level menu over the menu "
"styles. Each level is a light-DOM\n"
"`[data-page=\"id\"]` whose inner `.item`s are cloned into a shadow `.instui-"
"menu`; an item with\n"
"`data-goto=\"id\"` descends to that page and a synthesized Back row (or any "
"`[data-back]` item)\n"
"returns. The light DOM is the data source only — with no `&lt;slot&gt;` it "
"never renders, so shadow CSS\n"
"fully styles each panel. The `active` attribute reflects the current page "
"and can be set to\n"
"navigate; a bubbling `navigate` event (`detail.page`) fires on every move. "
"Drivable from light DOM\n"
"via Invoker Commands: `<button command=\"--goto\" commandfor=\"dd-id\" data-"
"page=\"…\">` descends and\n"
"`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"dd-id\">` returns."

