"`constrain` maps to\n"
"`-constrain-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `cover`, `contain`) and `display=\"block\"` "
"to `-display-block`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-in-place-edit>` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as text; on "
"click/focus it becomes\n"
"editable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with "
"`detail.value`), and\n"
"Escape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An "
"external `value` change\n"
"reflects into the field while it isn't being edited."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-in-place-edit&gt;` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as "
"text; on click/focus it becomes\n"
"editable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with "
"`detail.value`), and\n"
"Escape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An "
"external `value` change\n"
"reflects into the field while it isn't being edited."

