#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-modal>` — a real `<dialog>`, so it gets focus trapping, Escape-to-"
"close, and a\n"
"`::backdrop` for free. The `open` attribute drives `showModal()`/`close()`; "
"a native dismissal\n"
"(Escape or a backdrop click) reflects back to the attribute and re-fires as "
"a bubbling `close`\n"
"event. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands — a\n"
"`<button command=\"--show|--close|--toggle\" commandfor=\"modal-id\">` "
"toggles it by id. Content goes\n"
"in the default slot."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-modal&gt;` — a real `&lt;dialog&gt;`, so it gets focus trapping, "
"Escape-to-close, and a\n"
"`::backdrop` for free. The `open` attribute drives `showModal()`/`close()`; "
"a native dismissal\n"
"(Escape or a backdrop click) reflects back to the attribute and re-fires as "
"a bubbling `close`\n"
"event. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands — a\n"
"`<button command=\"--show|--close|--toggle\" commandfor=\"modal-id\">` "
"toggles it by id. Content goes\n"
"in the default slot."

