msgid ""
"`<instui-progress>` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `<progress>` "
"or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-progress&gt;` — a horizontal indicator backed by native "
"`&lt;progress&gt;` or `&lt;meter&gt;` semantics."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive "
"the range. A zero\n"
"minimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. "
"Add the boolean\n"
"`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. "
"`variant` maps the\n"
"component to `-color-<variant>` and `label` supplies its accessible name."
msgstr ""
"`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive "
"the range. A zero\n"
"minimum renders a native `&lt;progress&gt;`; a non-zero minimum renders "
"`&lt;meter&gt;`. Add the boolean\n"
"`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. "
"`variant` maps the\n"
"component to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` and `label` supplies its accessible "
"name."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-progress-circle>` — a circular indicator backed by native "
