#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-tooltip>` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from "
"the `tip` attribute)\n"
"on hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `bottom`, "
"`end`); `show-delay` and\n"
"`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. "
"JS owns the timing:\n"
"a `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/"
"`:focus-within` auto-show\n"
"so the delay actually applies."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-tooltip&gt;` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble "
"(from the `tip` attribute)\n"
"on hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. "
"`bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n"
"`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. "
"JS owns the timing:\n"
"a `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/"
"`:focus-within` auto-show\n"
"so the delay actually applies."

