#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"`<instui-truncate>` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines with an "
"ellipsis. `lines`\n"
"accepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom "
"property directly.\n"
"`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies "
"that as `--lines`.\n"
"Omit `lines` for single-line truncation."
msgstr ""
"`&lt;instui-truncate&gt;` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines "
"with an ellipsis. `lines`\n"
"accepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom "
"property directly.\n"
"`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies "
"that as `--lines`.\n"
"Omit `lines` for single-line truncation."

