#: tools/aggregate/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta "
"package's dependencies\n"
"for the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as <key> from "
"\"<pkg>\"`), one\n"
"subpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — "
"so adding a new target\n"
"package with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel "
"edits."
msgstr ""
"The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta "
"package's dependencies\n"
"for the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as "
"&lt;key&gt; from \"&lt;pkg&gt;\"`), one\n"
"subpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — "
"so adding a new target\n"
"package with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel "
"edits."

