msgstr "The aggregation key / export name, e.g. `astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"How the target is exposed:\n"
"- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n"
"- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the "
"barrel.\n"
"- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers "
"like React, so\n"
"  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr ""
"How the target is exposed:\n"
"- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n"
"- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the "
"barrel.\n"
"- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers "
"like React, so\n"
"  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."

