"(translated prose, same markup)\n"
"loads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."
msgstr ""
"Route a `demo:self:&lt;name&gt;` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo "
"directory, from the current\n"
"page's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, "
"`\"\"` for the root\n"
"locale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo "
"(translated prose, same markup)\n"
"loads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."

