#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid ""
"A hoverable \"view fullscreen\" button, overlaid on a demo/example frame the "
"same way VitePress's own\n"
"code-block \"copy\" button reveals on hover. Purely markup — wire a "
"delegated click handler in your\n"
"host page "
"(`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; see "
"the pantoken docs\n"
"theme for the reference wiring) and style the reveal-on-hover with "
"`@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr ""
"A hoverable \"view fullscreen\" button, overlaid on a demo/example frame the "
"same way VitePress's own\n"
"code-block \"copy\" button reveals on hover. Purely markup — wire a "
"delegated click handler in your\n"
"host page "
"(`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; see "
"the pantoken docs\n"
"theme for the reference wiring) and style the reveal-on-hover with "
"`@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."

